'''Illes del Guano Airport''' ({{lang|ca|Aeroport de les Illes del Guano}}; [[IATA airport code|IATA]]: IGU, [[ICAO airport code|ICAO]]: IGIB) is a domestic airport serving the [[Illes del Guano]], an island community in [[Estret Province]], [[Balboa]]. The airport is jet-capable and provides the primary air link to the islands, which are known for their guano deposits and coastal ecology. It is served by [[Aeroístmus]] from [[Sant Cristòfor International Airport|Sant Cristòfor]].

